WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.583
Ready to move beyond Fishbowl?

00:01.672 --> 00:03.533
Start your move to Spark.

00:04.017 --> 00:06.169
Bring your inventory and sales history.

00:06.293 --> 00:10.414
Spark DemandIQ considers each product's demand patterns, from

00:10.414 --> 00:13.618
seasonal peaks to growing sales, plus the changes

00:13.618 --> 00:14.679
you're planning for.

00:15.256 --> 00:18.336
Turn that forecast into reorder points and draft

00:18.367 --> 00:19.370
purchase orders.

00:19.853 --> 00:21.843
See the difference using your own numbers.

00:22.164 --> 00:23.468
Move on your timeline.

00:23.859 --> 00:26.785
Spark is free until your current Fishbowl contract

00:26.785 --> 00:29.877
ends, with migration and onboarding included.

00:30.268 --> 00:33.093
Start your move at Spark Inventory dot com.
